[
  {
    "text": "Kaylee, you did it! You won the Polar Explorer trophy!",
    "voice": "sparkle",
    "sig": "ed7dbdac3d",
    "ms": 5398,
    "file": "801a80e65ce3.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "Kaylee, Polar Explorer! From The Poles.",
    "voice": "sparkle",
    "sig": "ed7dbdac3d",
    "ms": 3890,
    "file": "045a038371ab.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "These are the Poles! The top and the bottom of the world.",
    "voice": "sparkle",
    "sig": "ed7dbdac3d",
    "ms": 4037,
    "file": "03e1ac984ce6.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "The North Pole is a frozen ocean. The South Pole is a frozen land.",
    "voice": "sparkle",
    "sig": "ed7dbdac3d",
    "ms": 5927,
    "file": "7c581b70107f.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "Polar bears live in the north, and penguins live in the south. They never meet!",
    "voice": "sparkle",
    "sig": "ed7dbdac3d",
    "ms": 5920,
    "file": "753d410eb192.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "When it's summer at the North Pole, it's winter at the South Pole.",
    "voice": "sparkle",
    "sig": "ed7dbdac3d",
    "ms": 4683,
    "file": "746535390ff3.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "At the poles, the sun stays up for months, then stays down for months.",
    "voice": "sparkle",
    "sig": "ed7dbdac3d",
    "ms": 5303,
    "file": "fc491001db9d.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "Antarctica is the coldest, windiest place on Earth.",
    "voice": "sparkle",
    "sig": "ed7dbdac3d",
    "ms": 4649,
    "file": "a2f934421e35.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "Most of an iceberg is hidden under the water.",
    "voice": "sparkle",
    "sig": "ed7dbdac3d",
    "ms": 3341,
    "file": "cf056acfc227.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "Antarctica's ice holds most of the world's fresh water.",
    "voice": "sparkle",
    "sig": "ed7dbdac3d",
    "ms": 4541,
    "file": "ca0319af143b.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "Nobody lives in Antarctica for good, but scientists work there together.",
    "voice": "sparkle",
    "sig": "ed7dbdac3d",
    "ms": 5146,
    "file": "85304fe34b22.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "Polar bears have black skin under their white fur.",
    "voice": "sparkle",
    "sig": "ed7dbdac3d",
    "ms": 3513,
    "file": "a74ae22ae9b9.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "Arctic foxes turn white in winter and brown in summer.",
    "voice": "sparkle",
    "sig": "ed7dbdac3d",
    "ms": 4797,
    "file": "6a45a4500440.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "Penguins slide on their tummies to go fast.",
    "voice": "sparkle",
    "sig": "ed7dbdac3d",
    "ms": 3434,
    "file": "278dc5fcd596.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "Emperor penguin dads keep the egg warm on their feet.",
    "voice": "sparkle",
    "sig": "ed7dbdac3d",
    "ms": 4728,
    "file": "18d922008b19.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "Narwhals have a long tooth that grows out like a unicorn horn!",
    "voice": "sparkle",
    "sig": "ed7dbdac3d",
    "ms": 6187,
    "file": "066c10b456cc.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "Want to see real polar bear cubs on the ice?",
    "voice": "sparkle",
    "sig": "ed7dbdac3d",
    "ms": 3303,
    "file": "564b30770bba.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "Want to see foxes that turn white for winter?",
    "voice": "sparkle",
    "sig": "ed7dbdac3d",
    "ms": 3002,
    "file": "357e0370f0ee.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "Let's see penguins zoom out of the sea!",
    "voice": "sparkle",
    "sig": "ed7dbdac3d",
    "ms": 2974,
    "file": "0c49c18336fe.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "Let's see the penguin dads huddle!",
    "voice": "sparkle",
    "sig": "ed7dbdac3d",
    "ms": 2407,
    "file": "8a842f3291ec.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "Want to see a real iceberg break off?",
    "voice": "sparkle",
    "sig": "ed7dbdac3d",
    "ms": 3015,
    "file": "78df3daa0c38.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "Let's see narwhals, the unicorns of the sea!",
    "voice": "sparkle",
    "sig": "ed7dbdac3d",
    "ms": 3848,
    "file": "bda61dfe0899.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "Welcome to the Poles! Grab the globe and spin it.",
    "voice": "sparkle",
    "sig": "ed7dbdac3d",
    "ms": 4157,
    "file": "6339b7068d20.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "Spin the globe up or down!",
    "voice": "sparkle",
    "sig": "ed7dbdac3d",
    "ms": 2162,
    "file": "03bbff79e797.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "Hi! I'm Pola. I live on the sea ice!",
    "voice": "pola",
    "sig": "2c88a3bfe7",
    "ms": 3974,
    "file": "11654609c30b.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "Hi! I'm Pebble. I live in Antarctica!",
    "voice": "pebble",
    "sig": "77076520c0",
    "ms": 3109,
    "file": "d28e1d211174.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "Ha ha, that tickles!",
    "voice": "pola",
    "sig": "2c88a3bfe7",
    "ms": 2087,
    "file": "063e0800181d.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "The ice floats on the sea!",
    "voice": "pola",
    "sig": "2c88a3bfe7",
    "ms": 2186,
    "file": "71a512a22ec7.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "Brr! I love the cold!",
    "voice": "pola",
    "sig": "2c88a3bfe7",
    "ms": 2703,
    "file": "8f332f76e701.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "Hello again!",
    "voice": "pebble",
    "sig": "77076520c0",
    "ms": 708,
    "file": "8f777315cb2c.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "Waddle, waddle!",
    "voice": "pebble",
    "sig": "77076520c0",
    "ms": 1646,
    "file": "d51ad1390f47.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "No polar bears down here!",
    "voice": "pebble",
    "sig": "77076520c0",
    "ms": 1689,
    "file": "b42f8bccfcb7.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "Tap a picture to play!",
    "voice": "sparkle",
    "sig": "ed7dbdac3d",
    "ms": 2576,
    "file": "088dc761cf9e.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "You got every stamp! Tap the party!",
    "voice": "sparkle",
    "sig": "ed7dbdac3d",
    "ms": 3105,
    "file": "90fdba831de6.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "Here comes the sun! Drag it!",
    "voice": "sparkle",
    "sig": "ed7dbdac3d",
    "ms": 3318,
    "file": "cbfdc53f15bf.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "Drag the sun up or down!",
    "voice": "sparkle",
    "sig": "ed7dbdac3d",
    "ms": 2225,
    "file": "0f3cd0e36e24.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "Summer up north, and night down south!",
    "voice": "sparkle",
    "sig": "ed7dbdac3d",
    "ms": 3055,
    "file": "9c586f4cc957.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "Summer down south, night up north!",
    "voice": "sparkle",
    "sig": "ed7dbdac3d",
    "ms": 3157,
    "file": "fc0be4594f75.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "A lost penguin! Carry him home.",
    "voice": "sparkle",
    "sig": "ed7dbdac3d",
    "ms": 2903,
    "file": "b3ee1adcd8a0.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "A lost polar bear cub! Carry her home.",
    "voice": "sparkle",
    "sig": "ed7dbdac3d",
    "ms": 4003,
    "file": "4c421ff233c1.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "Carry it home: the top or the bottom?",
    "voice": "sparkle",
    "sig": "ed7dbdac3d",
    "ms": 2890,
    "file": "c9b9066d904d.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "Yay! Welcome home!",
    "voice": "pebble",
    "sig": "77076520c0",
    "ms": 2096,
    "file": "4a5a5f77ca23.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "Welcome home, little cub!",
    "voice": "pola",
    "sig": "2c88a3bfe7",
    "ms": 2110,
    "file": "a7295c814ec2.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "A penguin? Penguins live down south!",
    "voice": "pola",
    "sig": "2c88a3bfe7",
    "ms": 2795,
    "file": "c9f03628ffe5.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "Eek! Polar bears live up north!",
    "voice": "pebble",
    "sig": "77076520c0",
    "ms": 2177,
    "file": "5e8e9bedf2b7.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "This is the North Pole, the very top of the world!",
    "voice": "sparkle",
    "sig": "ed7dbdac3d",
    "ms": 4132,
    "file": "43cb4ffd20a0.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "Seals pop up through holes in the ice to breathe.",
    "voice": "sparkle",
    "sig": "ed7dbdac3d",
    "ms": 3825,
    "file": "79152e769695.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "Scientists stay here to learn about the ice.",
    "voice": "sparkle",
    "sig": "ed7dbdac3d",
    "ms": 3583,
    "file": "00fb82254a2f.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "Whales swim in the cold seas at both poles.",
    "voice": "sparkle",
    "sig": "ed7dbdac3d",
    "ms": 4388,
    "file": "d6b42d61c1db.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "The northern lights! They dance in the dark winter sky.",
    "voice": "sparkle",
    "sig": "ed7dbdac3d",
    "ms": 4136,
    "file": "366e7c22fdcc.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "The southern lights! They glow in the long winter night.",
    "voice": "sparkle",
    "sig": "ed7dbdac3d",
    "ms": 4493,
    "file": "1d108e5df93d.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "Mama! I am way over here!",
    "voice": "pola",
    "sig": "2c88a3bfe7",
    "ms": 2638,
    "file": "a78a4546df20.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "Pull Pola back, and let go!",
    "voice": "sparkle",
    "sig": "ed7dbdac3d",
    "ms": 2782,
    "file": "179149b706c3.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "The ice is drifting. Wait, then fling!",
    "voice": "sparkle",
    "sig": "ed7dbdac3d",
    "ms": 3334,
    "file": "2a16292e274e.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "Summer melts the ice. Push floes together!",
    "voice": "sparkle",
    "sig": "ed7dbdac3d",
    "ms": 4202,
    "file": "853ea359765a.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "Whoa! This ice is moving!",
    "voice": "pola",
    "sig": "2c88a3bfe7",
    "ms": 2565,
    "file": "4e4ac0b1ddc6.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "The ice is so little now!",
    "voice": "pola",
    "sig": "2c88a3bfe7",
    "ms": 1978,
    "file": "4e1513b2f902.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "Splash! I love swimming!",
    "voice": "pola",
    "sig": "2c88a3bfe7",
    "ms": 2589,
    "file": "8e6201bc8937.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "Polar bears are great swimmers!",
    "voice": "pola",
    "sig": "2c88a3bfe7",
    "ms": 2023,
    "file": "9c13cd1c870a.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "Wheee! Splash!",
    "voice": "pola",
    "sig": "2c88a3bfe7",
    "ms": 2116,
    "file": "8c78fef94a13.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "Brr! Paddle paddle!",
    "voice": "pola",
    "sig": "2c88a3bfe7",
    "ms": 2535,
    "file": "e67fec8226ae.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "Wheee! A slide!",
    "voice": "pola",
    "sig": "2c88a3bfe7",
    "ms": 2126,
    "file": "d56aff9c9646.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "Whoops! Too tippy!",
    "voice": "pola",
    "sig": "2c88a3bfe7",
    "ms": 2049,
    "file": "ae9b08f44ee1.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "Hee hee!",
    "voice": "pola",
    "sig": "2c88a3bfe7",
    "ms": 884,
    "file": "f54408fa888f.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "That tickles!",
    "voice": "pola",
    "sig": "2c88a3bfe7",
    "ms": 1212,
    "file": "8687bf4f8c53.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "Again! Again!",
    "voice": "pola",
    "sig": "2c88a3bfe7",
    "ms": 1726,
    "file": "0a5bf4f3f970.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "Hop home to me, Pola!",
    "voice": "mama",
    "sig": "13d0232cf0",
    "ms": 2520,
    "file": "bb555c15db9b.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "I am right here, Pola!",
    "voice": "mama",
    "sig": "13d0232cf0",
    "ms": 2282,
    "file": "bb3380b837a0.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "You can do it, little one!",
    "voice": "mama",
    "sig": "13d0232cf0",
    "ms": 2266,
    "file": "e317100c2284.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "Keep hopping!",
    "voice": "mama",
    "sig": "13d0232cf0",
    "ms": 1514,
    "file": "acf3f8777239.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "This ice is floating on the sea!",
    "voice": "sparkle",
    "sig": "ed7dbdac3d",
    "ms": 2564,
    "file": "033b32c7d39d.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "The North Pole is a frozen sea. There is water under the ice!",
    "voice": "sparkle",
    "sig": "ed7dbdac3d",
    "ms": 4853,
    "file": "0d99601e2227.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "A seal! It breathes through a hole in the ice.",
    "voice": "sparkle",
    "sig": "ed7dbdac3d",
    "ms": 3794,
    "file": "46b68ceeb685.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "A narwhal! The unicorn of the sea!",
    "voice": "sparkle",
    "sig": "ed7dbdac3d",
    "ms": 4155,
    "file": "d82e28891eb4.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "Walruses use their long tusks to climb onto the ice.",
    "voice": "sparkle",
    "sig": "ed7dbdac3d",
    "ms": 4663,
    "file": "e8948006e29e.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "Belugas are white whales. They sing squeaky songs!",
    "voice": "sparkle",
    "sig": "ed7dbdac3d",
    "ms": 4117,
    "file": "71364bb0afc7.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "My brave little cub! You made it!",
    "voice": "mama",
    "sig": "13d0232cf0",
    "ms": 3419,
    "file": "49d7e8351b12.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "Mama! I hopped all the way home!",
    "voice": "pola",
    "sig": "2c88a3bfe7",
    "ms": 2958,
    "file": "d49517138498.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "Kaylee, you got Pola home!",
    "voice": "sparkle",
    "sig": "ed7dbdac3d",
    "ms": 2587,
    "file": "26a6fa0a76af.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "Brr, winter is coming! Rub snow on the fox.",
    "voice": "sparkle",
    "sig": "ed7dbdac3d",
    "ms": 4730,
    "file": "34e43f2c1f69.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "Rub the fox with your finger.",
    "voice": "sparkle",
    "sig": "ed7dbdac3d",
    "ms": 2607,
    "file": "af4ac8d6022e.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "Now rub them all white, so they can hide!",
    "voice": "sparkle",
    "sig": "ed7dbdac3d",
    "ms": 3115,
    "file": "bd613e9c493c.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "Rub snow on the brown ones.",
    "voice": "sparkle",
    "sig": "ed7dbdac3d",
    "ms": 2303,
    "file": "86f13362e303.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "Shh! Here comes the polar bear.",
    "voice": "sparkle",
    "sig": "ed7dbdac3d",
    "ms": 3434,
    "file": "3a92dccff89d.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "He saw some brown! Make it white.",
    "voice": "sparkle",
    "sig": "ed7dbdac3d",
    "ms": 2779,
    "file": "603ca030a0a5.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "He can't find anyone! White hides in the snow.",
    "voice": "sparkle",
    "sig": "ed7dbdac3d",
    "ms": 3711,
    "file": "e28442e5beef.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "Tap the sun to bring the summer.",
    "voice": "sparkle",
    "sig": "ed7dbdac3d",
    "ms": 2611,
    "file": "5c8eba698083.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "Summer is here! Rub the snow away.",
    "voice": "sparkle",
    "sig": "ed7dbdac3d",
    "ms": 3226,
    "file": "ca29e89512fb.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "Rub them brown again.",
    "voice": "sparkle",
    "sig": "ed7dbdac3d",
    "ms": 1863,
    "file": "80942e395da6.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "Snowy owls and polar bears stay white all year!",
    "voice": "sparkle",
    "sig": "ed7dbdac3d",
    "ms": 3846,
    "file": "3e3be8899c8c.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "Brown coats for the summer!",
    "voice": "sparkle",
    "sig": "ed7dbdac3d",
    "ms": 1970,
    "file": "97c18c71f53c.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "Arctic hares have black tips on their ears.",
    "voice": "sparkle",
    "sig": "ed7dbdac3d",
    "ms": 3467,
    "file": "9f73665b9e05.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "This bird is a ptarmigan. Even its feet go white!",
    "voice": "sparkle",
    "sig": "ed7dbdac3d",
    "ms": 4418,
    "file": "42d1c547343b.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "Lemmings live in tunnels under the snow.",
    "voice": "sparkle",
    "sig": "ed7dbdac3d",
    "ms": 3002,
    "file": "03bb076e42f9.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "Polar bears are white all year.",
    "voice": "sparkle",
    "sig": "ed7dbdac3d",
    "ms": 2561,
    "file": "d61b1443db8b.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "White fur hides in white snow. That's camouflage!",
    "voice": "sparkle",
    "sig": "ed7dbdac3d",
    "ms": 4223,
    "file": "9082aa3ef3fb.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "Lots of animals live on the land around the frozen sea.",
    "voice": "sparkle",
    "sig": "ed7dbdac3d",
    "ms": 3994,
    "file": "f1069b739705.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "Papa, I'm so hungry!",
    "voice": "pebble",
    "sig": "77076520c0",
    "ms": 1971,
    "file": "be7f3dd6a877.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "Krill coming right up!",
    "voice": "papa",
    "sig": "c038db870a",
    "ms": 1715,
    "file": "83d8761ab354.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "Steer Papa left and right!",
    "voice": "sparkle",
    "sig": "ed7dbdac3d",
    "ms": 2571,
    "file": "76ae5dd132b6.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "Bumps! Pick a way down the hill!",
    "voice": "sparkle",
    "sig": "ed7dbdac3d",
    "ms": 2691,
    "file": "64b64af148ec.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "Steer Papa to the pink krill!",
    "voice": "sparkle",
    "sig": "ed7dbdac3d",
    "ms": 3130,
    "file": "efd6a3f76ad4.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "Antarctica is one big hill of ice!",
    "voice": "sparkle",
    "sig": "ed7dbdac3d",
    "ms": 3699,
    "file": "847b071efea0.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "Penguins fly under the water!",
    "voice": "sparkle",
    "sig": "ed7dbdac3d",
    "ms": 2570,
    "file": "6766e646b03b.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "Whoa, I can fly!",
    "voice": "papa",
    "sig": "c038db870a",
    "ms": 2613,
    "file": "ce257090c0fc.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "Wheee!",
    "voice": "papa",
    "sig": "c038db870a",
    "ms": 874,
    "file": "1b068a213f0b.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "Oops! Snow on my beak!",
    "voice": "papa",
    "sig": "c038db870a",
    "ms": 2467,
    "file": "f8e2c0c39172.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "Brr, a snowy nose!",
    "voice": "papa",
    "sig": "c038db870a",
    "ms": 2898,
    "file": "0c641e4a8bc0.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "Oh! Sorry, little friend!",
    "voice": "papa",
    "sig": "c038db870a",
    "ms": 2540,
    "file": "f1cb2b65544a.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "Round and round!",
    "voice": "papa",
    "sig": "c038db870a",
    "ms": 1694,
    "file": "757f95f15eb3.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "Hello, silly seal!",
    "voice": "papa",
    "sig": "c038db870a",
    "ms": 1870,
    "file": "709e61b3e74d.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "Yum, krill!",
    "voice": "papa",
    "sig": "c038db870a",
    "ms": 1994,
    "file": "72030545310c.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "Gulp!",
    "voice": "papa",
    "sig": "c038db870a",
    "ms": 626,
    "file": "0e385c214496.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "More for Pebble!",
    "voice": "papa",
    "sig": "c038db870a",
    "ms": 1452,
    "file": "8dceafb764a9.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "Pebble, I'm home!",
    "voice": "papa",
    "sig": "c038db870a",
    "ms": 2011,
    "file": "62f53b9681a7.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "Yummy! Thank you, Papa!",
    "voice": "pebble",
    "sig": "77076520c0",
    "ms": 1658,
    "file": "f57f91c1c977.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "Hee hee!",
    "voice": "pebble",
    "sig": "77076520c0",
    "ms": 592,
    "file": "8e1c05c5b6c5.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "Hi, hi!",
    "voice": "pebble",
    "sig": "77076520c0",
    "ms": 1552,
    "file": "5d48a44f537e.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "Emperor penguins are the biggest penguins of all!",
    "voice": "sparkle",
    "sig": "ed7dbdac3d",
    "ms": 3101,
    "file": "c81edf7a62ed.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "These little ones are Adelie penguins.",
    "voice": "sparkle",
    "sig": "ed7dbdac3d",
    "ms": 2741,
    "file": "af8239d0781b.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "A leopard seal! This one just wants to play.",
    "voice": "sparkle",
    "sig": "ed7dbdac3d",
    "ms": 3824,
    "file": "72a091fc77e2.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "Penguin chicks eat krill, tiny pink sea animals.",
    "voice": "sparkle",
    "sig": "ed7dbdac3d",
    "ms": 4655,
    "file": "f127bdf33180.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "No polar bears live here, so the penguins are not scared.",
    "voice": "sparkle",
    "sig": "ed7dbdac3d",
    "ms": 4612,
    "file": "7c8f09c7c3ad.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "Carry the cold penguin into the middle!",
    "voice": "sparkle",
    "sig": "ed7dbdac3d",
    "ms": 2858,
    "file": "d2219330c6f9.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "More penguin dads are coming!",
    "voice": "sparkle",
    "sig": "ed7dbdac3d",
    "ms": 1757,
    "file": "301bc3422be1.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "A blizzard! Keep the cold ones moving in.",
    "voice": "sparkle",
    "sig": "ed7dbdac3d",
    "ms": 3450,
    "file": "d75992923889.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "The wind turned around!",
    "voice": "sparkle",
    "sig": "ed7dbdac3d",
    "ms": 2285,
    "file": "9f2400e3d473.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "Keep Pebble's papa warm in the middle.",
    "voice": "sparkle",
    "sig": "ed7dbdac3d",
    "ms": 2947,
    "file": "fc7bb3c5e7c4.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "Tuck Pebble back under Papa!",
    "voice": "sparkle",
    "sig": "ed7dbdac3d",
    "ms": 2362,
    "file": "1a506fa93f5c.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "Whoosh! Carry Pebble back to Papa.",
    "voice": "sparkle",
    "sig": "ed7dbdac3d",
    "ms": 3312,
    "file": "8e60555f4820.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "Look! The sun is coming back!",
    "voice": "sparkle",
    "sig": "ed7dbdac3d",
    "ms": 3061,
    "file": "c46f7d2947dc.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "You kept them all warm, Kaylee!",
    "voice": "sparkle",
    "sig": "ed7dbdac3d",
    "ms": 3006,
    "file": "dc1b58ebba7f.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "Emperor dads keep the egg warm on their feet!",
    "voice": "sparkle",
    "sig": "ed7dbdac3d",
    "ms": 4366,
    "file": "a2777b0e3198.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "In winter here, the sun stays away for months!",
    "voice": "sparkle",
    "sig": "ed7dbdac3d",
    "ms": 4466,
    "file": "3b95d17c3296.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "Brrr! So cold!",
    "voice": "papa",
    "sig": "c038db870a",
    "ms": 2646,
    "file": "cd9cda0b492c.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "Ahh, much better!",
    "voice": "papa",
    "sig": "c038db870a",
    "ms": 2186,
    "file": "b0623ea5b410.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "Thank you! So cozy.",
    "voice": "papa",
    "sig": "c038db870a",
    "ms": 2695,
    "file": "7dca8d22553e.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "Warm at last!",
    "voice": "papa",
    "sig": "c038db870a",
    "ms": 1709,
    "file": "57121fe3d607.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "My egg is getting cold!",
    "voice": "papa",
    "sig": "c038db870a",
    "ms": 1854,
    "file": "6da6039be824.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "Hello, little Pebble!",
    "voice": "papa",
    "sig": "c038db870a",
    "ms": 2448,
    "file": "111921c36990.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "Oh no! Pebble!",
    "voice": "papa",
    "sig": "c038db870a",
    "ms": 1893,
    "file": "32e013c24031.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "There you are, Pebble!",
    "voice": "papa",
    "sig": "c038db870a",
    "ms": 1805,
    "file": "0e898ceaae23.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "Look, Pebble. The sun!",
    "voice": "papa",
    "sig": "c038db870a",
    "ms": 2475,
    "file": "f9bba19d9be2.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "Hi, Papa! Peep peep!",
    "voice": "pebble",
    "sig": "77076520c0",
    "ms": 1835,
    "file": "d65f875ea467.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "Whoa! Papa, help!",
    "voice": "pebble",
    "sig": "77076520c0",
    "ms": 2282,
    "file": "b78e19bd26eb.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "So cozy!",
    "voice": "pebble",
    "sig": "77076520c0",
    "ms": 1283,
    "file": "5a8774deacfe.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "Ooh, so pretty!",
    "voice": "pebble",
    "sig": "77076520c0",
    "ms": 2234,
    "file": "0f76dda4a937.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "Pick a pole: north or south?",
    "voice": "sparkle",
    "sig": "ed7dbdac3d",
    "ms": 2762,
    "file": "979011ff14de.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "Tap the cracks to break off the ice!",
    "voice": "sparkle",
    "sig": "ed7dbdac3d",
    "ms": 3378,
    "file": "444880a39bb1.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "A giant crack! Tap, tap, tap!",
    "voice": "sparkle",
    "sig": "ed7dbdac3d",
    "ms": 3310,
    "file": "d333b52a9703.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "Look how big it is under the water!",
    "voice": "sparkle",
    "sig": "ed7dbdac3d",
    "ms": 3393,
    "file": "0b865e1904fd.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "Push the iceberg down with your finger!",
    "voice": "sparkle",
    "sig": "ed7dbdac3d",
    "ms": 2525,
    "file": "ce16db56197d.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "Now push the icebergs out to sea!",
    "voice": "sparkle",
    "sig": "ed7dbdac3d",
    "ms": 3196,
    "file": "9d2f0427ffa6.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "Your icebergs are sailing away!",
    "voice": "sparkle",
    "sig": "ed7dbdac3d",
    "ms": 2647,
    "file": "86102d4c2525.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "When ice breaks off, it's called calving!",
    "voice": "sparkle",
    "sig": "ed7dbdac3d",
    "ms": 3196,
    "file": "ff6dbed19602.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "Icebergs up north are tall and pointy.",
    "voice": "sparkle",
    "sig": "ed7dbdac3d",
    "ms": 2912,
    "file": "cb4f9343c592.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "Icebergs down south are flat, like a table!",
    "voice": "sparkle",
    "sig": "ed7dbdac3d",
    "ms": 3405,
    "file": "037e196d6a89.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "Most of it hides under the sea!",
    "voice": "sparkle",
    "sig": "ed7dbdac3d",
    "ms": 2695,
    "file": "2490c91794a2.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "Icebergs are made of snow, so they're not salty!",
    "voice": "sparkle",
    "sig": "ed7dbdac3d",
    "ms": 3426,
    "file": "59505e679b1b.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "Fizz! Old air bubbles pop out of the ice.",
    "voice": "sparkle",
    "sig": "ed7dbdac3d",
    "ms": 3464,
    "file": "eb39f5790904.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "Old ice is packed so tight, it looks blue!",
    "voice": "sparkle",
    "sig": "ed7dbdac3d",
    "ms": 4203,
    "file": "0032f07b1ba2.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "A seal is napping on a little iceberg.",
    "voice": "sparkle",
    "sig": "ed7dbdac3d",
    "ms": 3332,
    "file": "ed3c6cddcf21.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "Orcas live at both poles!",
    "voice": "sparkle",
    "sig": "ed7dbdac3d",
    "ms": 2295,
    "file": "b468590d7ebc.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "Hi! Break off some ice with me!",
    "voice": "pola",
    "sig": "2c88a3bfe7",
    "ms": 2650,
    "file": "5c6f2dd79e68.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "Wheee, splash!",
    "voice": "pola",
    "sig": "2c88a3bfe7",
    "ms": 2554,
    "file": "b3ac67f4ac86.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "Ooh, a little one!",
    "voice": "pola",
    "sig": "2c88a3bfe7",
    "ms": 1900,
    "file": "5eef52df5ac3.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "Another one!",
    "voice": "pola",
    "sig": "2c88a3bfe7",
    "ms": 1051,
    "file": "87fa6d7a9999.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "Whoa! It's a big one!",
    "voice": "pola",
    "sig": "2c88a3bfe7",
    "ms": 3120,
    "file": "03f30b423670.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "Splash! I'm all wet!",
    "voice": "pola",
    "sig": "2c88a3bfe7",
    "ms": 2851,
    "file": "45ee8b646bf6.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "Wow, it goes way down!",
    "voice": "pola",
    "sig": "2c88a3bfe7",
    "ms": 2882,
    "file": "067765d5e5b5.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "I'm riding the iceberg!",
    "voice": "pola",
    "sig": "2c88a3bfe7",
    "ms": 1917,
    "file": "ed0d4c82d8db.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "Hi again!",
    "voice": "pola",
    "sig": "2c88a3bfe7",
    "ms": 1025,
    "file": "544f8d040904.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "Bye bye, icebergs!",
    "voice": "pola",
    "sig": "2c88a3bfe7",
    "ms": 1550,
    "file": "c0641edf1804.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "Welcome to our ice shelf!",
    "voice": "papa",
    "sig": "c038db870a",
    "ms": 1970,
    "file": "ff25efa4bf93.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "Splendid!",
    "voice": "papa",
    "sig": "c038db870a",
    "ms": 1110,
    "file": "f9088a61b34b.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "Plop, into the sea!",
    "voice": "papa",
    "sig": "c038db870a",
    "ms": 2336,
    "file": "6e03f72788f2.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "Another one!",
    "voice": "papa",
    "sig": "c038db870a",
    "ms": 1167,
    "file": "5b34debce24b.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "Oh my, a giant!",
    "voice": "papa",
    "sig": "c038db870a",
    "ms": 2893,
    "file": "75cc102ae9ec.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "Brr! A cold shower!",
    "voice": "papa",
    "sig": "c038db870a",
    "ms": 2730,
    "file": "52f94e6afa94.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "So much ice under the water!",
    "voice": "papa",
    "sig": "c038db870a",
    "ms": 2671,
    "file": "3dbc0b8ef133.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "All aboard, everyone!",
    "voice": "papa",
    "sig": "c038db870a",
    "ms": 2079,
    "file": "ea639764ee77.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "Hello there!",
    "voice": "papa",
    "sig": "c038db870a",
    "ms": 939,
    "file": "44cd3d594116.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "Honk honk!",
    "voice": "papa",
    "sig": "c038db870a",
    "ms": 1477,
    "file": "f5e1c215cea8.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "Off they go! Thank you!",
    "voice": "papa",
    "sig": "c038db870a",
    "ms": 1934,
    "file": "9cd04dfa3603.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "Pola's postcard! Let's fly it to Pebble!",
    "voice": "terry",
    "sig": "164d612c04",
    "ms": 3286,
    "file": "f3fd83dac3be.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "Steer Terry with your finger!",
    "voice": "sparkle",
    "sig": "ed7dbdac3d",
    "ms": 2787,
    "file": "3b8176178bc2.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "Move your finger to steer Terry!",
    "voice": "sparkle",
    "sig": "ed7dbdac3d",
    "ms": 3813,
    "file": "720484ab957d.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "Phew! It's warm in the middle of the world!",
    "voice": "terry",
    "sig": "164d612c04",
    "ms": 3470,
    "file": "b5853da34963.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "Brr, it's windy! Nearly at the South Pole!",
    "voice": "terry",
    "sig": "164d612c04",
    "ms": 3928,
    "file": "53af029ee6dc.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "Yum, a fish!",
    "voice": "terry",
    "sig": "164d612c04",
    "ms": 1947,
    "file": "41bbab082f75.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "Fishy!",
    "voice": "terry",
    "sig": "164d612c04",
    "ms": 746,
    "file": "ee5ae77cb1cc.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "Got one!",
    "voice": "terry",
    "sig": "164d612c04",
    "ms": 922,
    "file": "260bf3f0a1b4.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "Hello, Thailand!",
    "voice": "terry",
    "sig": "164d612c04",
    "ms": 1375,
    "file": "5329f6414428.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "Hello, Australia!",
    "voice": "terry",
    "sig": "164d612c04",
    "ms": 1742,
    "file": "a65f5500d56a.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "Hello, Italy!",
    "voice": "terry",
    "sig": "164d612c04",
    "ms": 1651,
    "file": "62c664a22583.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "Hello, China!",
    "voice": "terry",
    "sig": "164d612c04",
    "ms": 1653,
    "file": "765923cd8108.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "Hello, Egypt!",
    "voice": "terry",
    "sig": "164d612c04",
    "ms": 1442,
    "file": "056cd2ac4570.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "Hello, Peru!",
    "voice": "terry",
    "sig": "164d612c04",
    "ms": 1545,
    "file": "47f121a24b32.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "Hello, Canada!",
    "voice": "terry",
    "sig": "164d612c04",
    "ms": 1546,
    "file": "356b58508cb4.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "A postcard for you, Pebble!",
    "voice": "terry",
    "sig": "164d612c04",
    "ms": 2198,
    "file": "9f79fc0ad173.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "From Pola! Look, a polar bear!",
    "voice": "pebble",
    "sig": "77076520c0",
    "ms": 2246,
    "file": "a1aae28f6db4.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "Quiz time!",
    "voice": "sparkle",
    "sig": "ed7dbdac3d",
    "ms": 1419,
    "file": "c4ad91b93c2a.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "Put Pola where polar bears live!",
    "voice": "sparkle",
    "sig": "ed7dbdac3d",
    "ms": 2309,
    "file": "b21e405404be.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "Put Pebble where penguins live!",
    "voice": "sparkle",
    "sig": "ed7dbdac3d",
    "ms": 2960,
    "file": "cf049d6fbe8a.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "Spin the South Pole to the front!",
    "voice": "sparkle",
    "sig": "ed7dbdac3d",
    "ms": 2653,
    "file": "8186beca3ed2.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "Spin the North Pole to the front!",
    "voice": "sparkle",
    "sig": "ed7dbdac3d",
    "ms": 3067,
    "file": "798259c927b4.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "Which pole is ocean under the ice? Tap it!",
    "voice": "sparkle",
    "sig": "ed7dbdac3d",
    "ms": 3630,
    "file": "d87409439577.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "Which pole is the coldest? Tap it!",
    "voice": "sparkle",
    "sig": "ed7dbdac3d",
    "ms": 3388,
    "file": "1425ce2d7947.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "Who visits both poles? Tap them!",
    "voice": "sparkle",
    "sig": "ed7dbdac3d",
    "ms": 3100,
    "file": "b525f3430c92.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "It's summer up north. What is it down south?",
    "voice": "sparkle",
    "sig": "ed7dbdac3d",
    "ms": 3286,
    "file": "b58f1cd6cb4b.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "Where's the sea ice? I live up top!",
    "voice": "pola",
    "sig": "2c88a3bfe7",
    "ms": 2710,
    "file": "b56909b8a13c.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "Brr! Where is everybody?",
    "voice": "pebble",
    "sig": "77076520c0",
    "ms": 2134,
    "file": "0a173027ebd0.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "Wobble, wobble! Try the other end.",
    "voice": "sparkle",
    "sig": "ed7dbdac3d",
    "ms": 2823,
    "file": "535188dd7811.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "That's rock and land under there! Try the other pole.",
    "voice": "sparkle",
    "sig": "ed7dbdac3d",
    "ms": 4006,
